<component type="desktop-application">
  <id>com.github.sina.vpn-split-tunnel</id>
  <name>VPN Split Tunnel</name>
  <summary>Universal VPN Split Tunneling Manager</summary>
  <description>
    <p>A modern GTK4/libadwaita application for managing per-application and per-domain split tunneling across multiple VPN providers.</p>
    <p>Features:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Supports WireGuard, OpenVPN, Tailscale, Xray/Sing-box (VLESS/VMESS), Windscribe, HAP, NetworkManager VPN</li>
      <li>Two modes: Include (only selected traffic through VPN) and Exclude (all except selected through VPN)</li>
      <li>Application selection from installed apps with search</li>
      <li>Domain and IP/CIDR list management with import/export</li>
      <li>Light/Dark theme support</li>
      <li>Persian and English languages</li>
      <li>PolicyKit integration for secure privilege escalation</li>
      <li>nftables + cgroups v2 based implementation (like netslice)</li>
    </ul>
  </description>
